<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Inner Chamber</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/members.css">
</head>
<body>

  <header class="members-header">
    <div class="members-brand">
      <span class="brand-small">Ordo Praeconum Campanae Leonis</span>
      <h1>Inner Chamber</h1>
      <p class="brand-motto">Campana sonat omnibus</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="members-nav">
      <a href="/home">Home</a>
      <a href="/about">The Order</a>
      <a href="/bell">The Bell</a>
      <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="members-main">
    <section class="members-hero">
      <div class="hero-image-wrap">
        <img src="/images/bluebell.png" alt="Bell and sun emblem" class="hero-image">
      </div>

      <div class="hero-text">
        <p class="eyebrow">Welcome, Herald</p>
        <h2>The Daylit Chamber of Study</h2>
        <p>
          Beyond the threshold of the public order lies the chamber of reflection, study, and correspondence.
          Here the Bell is no longer distant. Its sound has already been heard.
        </p>
        <p>
          This space is devoted to doctrine, archive, and the living fellowship of those who continue along the path.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="members-divider">✶</div>

    <section class="members-grid">
      <article class="member-card">
        <h3>Doctrine</h3>
        <p>Study the philosophical foundations of the Order: awakening, unity, consciousness, and proclamation.</p>
        <a href="#">Enter Doctrine</a>
      </article>

      <article class="member-card">
        <h3>Archive</h3>
        <p>Read preserved texts, fragments, sayings, and developing writings of the Order.</p>
        <a href="#">Open Archive</a>
      </article>

      <article class="member-card">
        <h3>Correspondence</h3>
        <p>Access internal notices, letters, and future paths of communication among members.</p>
        <a href="#">View Correspondence</a>
      </article>
    </section>

    <div class="members-divider">☼</div>

    <section class="members-reflection">
      <h3>Reflection</h3>
      <blockquote>
        “The Bell rings for all. The awakened learn to hear its light.”
      </blockquote>
    </section>
  </main>

</body>
</html>